1
00:00:00,290 --> 00:00:01,460
Put your hand on a table.

2
00:00:02,190 --> 00:00:03,480
Do exactly this.

3
00:00:03,910 --> 00:00:04,580
Palm down.

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,520
Fold your middle finger under.

5
00:00:07,010 --> 00:00:07,700
Lift your thumb.

6
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:08,800
Easy.

7
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:09,800
Index.

8
00:00:10,150 --> 00:00:10,700
Easy.

9
00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:11,500
Pinky.

10
00:00:11,910 --> 00:00:12,600
Easy.

11
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:15,270
Now... your ring finger.

12
00:00:17,630 --> 00:00:18,450
Stuck?

13
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:19,800
Most people are.

14
00:00:20,150 --> 00:00:22,500
Your middle and ring fingers share one muscle,

15
00:00:22,670 --> 00:00:24,200
and their tendons are tied together.

16
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:27,400
So the folded middle finger holds the ring finger down...

17
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:28,400
like a leash.

18
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:30,700
Index and pinky have backup muscles.

19
00:00:31,020 --> 00:00:32,050
The ring finger doesn't.

20
00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:33,100
Could you lift it?

21
00:00:33,410 --> 00:00:34,900
Comment yes or no.
